            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593410/extras/b6c3b02fe354c5914185550d47cc69c0.avif?t=1488988864\" width=630 height=337 /></span><br>You have traveled around the world, and saw the destroyed Elven Kingdom on the way.<br>King's daughter - Princess Aerin, has asked for your help to restore the Kingdom and save their parents from captivity of the evil witch. <br><br>You agree to help the princess and and have this adventure with her.<br>On your way you will meet creepy monsters, scary beasts and the bewitched nature.<br>You will also meet new friends and help Aerin find the strength to banish the witch from the Elven Kingdom!<br><br>•\tMix of the time-management and strategy gameplays + use of the variable items <br>•\tCute fantasy atmosphere<br>•\tRepair buildings, restore trees, use unique units to perform unique tasks<br>•\t5 various locations, from forest to snow mountains, where lives many interesting inhabitants<br>•\tIntensive fun gameplay<br><br>Welcome to the world of  Elven Legend!",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593410/extras/b6c3b02fe354c5914185550d47cc69c0.avif?t=1488988864\" width=630 height=337 /></span><br>You have traveled around the world, and saw the destroyed Elven Kingdom on the way.<br>King's daughter - Princess Aerin, has asked for your help to restore the Kingdom and save their parents from captivity of the evil witch. <br><br>You agree to help the princess and and have this adventure with her.<br>On your way you will meet creepy monsters, scary beasts and the bewitched nature.<br>You will also meet new friends and help Aerin find the strength to banish the witch from the Elven Kingdom!<br><br>•\tMix of the time-management and strategy gameplays + use of the variable items <br>•\tCute fantasy atmosphere<br>•\tRepair buildings, restore trees, use unique units to perform unique tasks<br>•\t5 various locations, from forest to snow mountains, where lives many interesting inhabitants<br>•\tIntensive fun gameplay<br><br>Welcome to the world of  Elven Legend!",
